"Only the optional dependency corresponding to the JDBC driver of PostgreSQL "
"is expected in the final artifact."
msgstr ""

msgid "Configuring the Project Output"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"There are a several configuration options that will define what the output "
"of your project build will be.\n"
"These are provided in `application.properties` the same as any other config "
"property."
